# Template for .env.test.local — copy this file to .env.test.local and fill
# in the values. .env.test.local is gitignored; only this .example file (names,
# no secrets) is committed. Loaded by vitest.config.ts via loadEnv("test", ...)
# whenever you run `npm test`.
#
# DO NOT point this at your dev or production database. `npm test` truncates
# voters/variations/votes/comments after every test (see tests/setup.ts), so
# pointing DATABASE_URL here at anything other than a dedicated, disposable
# test database will destroy real data. Create a separate database (e.g. a
# separate Neon project/branch) reserved only for running this test suite.
DATABASE_URL=
